[{"answer":"Hi Coleman, how are you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/1_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Good, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/2_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I wanted to have a chat with you","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/3_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"because our friend Josh told me that you've joined a guitar group","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/4_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and it sounds interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/5_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd really like to learn myself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/6_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Why don't you come along?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/7_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure there's room for another person.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/8_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Really?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/9_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So... who runs the classes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/10_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"He's called a 'coordinator',","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/11_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"his name's Gary Mathieson.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/12_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me note that down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/13_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Gary....","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/14_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"How do you spell his surname?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/15_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's Mathieson.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/16_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/17_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"He's retired, actually, but he's a really nice guy","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/18_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and he used to play in a lot of bands.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/19_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/20_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So how long have you been going?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/21_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"About a month now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/22_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And could you play anything before you started?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/23_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I knew a few chords, but that's all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/24_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure everyone will be better than me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/25_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That's what I thought, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/26_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"When I first spoke to Gary on the phone,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/27_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"he said it was a class for beginners,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/28_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but I was still worried that everyone would be better than me,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/29_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but we were all equally hopeless!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/30_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's reassuring.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/31_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So where do you meet?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/32_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, when I joined the group, they were meeting in Gary's home,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/33_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but as the group got bigger, he decided to book a room at the college in town.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/34_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I prefer going there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/35_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I know that place.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/36_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I used to go to tap dancing classes there when I was at secondary school.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/37_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I haven't been since, though and I can't remember what road it's in...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/38_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it Lock Street?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/39_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's just beyond there at the bottom of New Street near the city roundabout.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/40_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/41_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The guitar club is on the first floor in Room T347.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/42_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/43_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And when do you meet?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/44_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it at the weekend?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/45_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"We meet on Thursdays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/46_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It used to be 10.30 and that suited me well,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/47_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but now we meet at 11.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/48_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The class that's in there before us asked if they could have the room for another 30 minutes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/49_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/50_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'd love to come, but I don't have a guitar.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/51_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, you can always buy a second-hand one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/52_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a website called 'The perfect instrument' that sells all kinds of guitars, violins and so on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/53_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure you'll find something there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/54_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So what's a typical lesson like with Gary?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/55_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, he always starts by getting us to tune our guitars.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/56_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That takes about five minutes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/57_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Uhuh...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/58_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people have an app they use, but others do it by ear.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/59_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Gary goes round and helps them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/60_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And while he's doing that, he tells us what he's going to do during the lesson.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/61_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/62_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"First, we usually spend about ten minutes doing some strumming.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/63_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So is that using...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/64_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh... what are they called...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/65_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Plectrums?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/66_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"No, we just use our thumbs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/67_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh... much easier.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/68_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Gary reminds us where to put our fingers for each chord and then we play them together.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/69_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes we all just start laughing because we're so bad at keeping time,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/70_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"so Gary starts clapping to help us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/71_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you learn to play any songs?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/72_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, we do at least one song with words and chords.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/73_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean that's harder than you think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/74_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I'm sure it is!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/75_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That part of the lesson takes about 15 minutes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/76_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"He often brings a recording of the song and plays it to us first.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/77_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Then he hands out the song and if there's a new chord in it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/78_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"we practise that before we play it together, but really slowly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/79_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you do any finger picking?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/80_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That's the last ten minutes of the lesson,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/81_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"when we pick out the individual notes from a tune he's made up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/82_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's always quite simple.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/83_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That must be hard, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/84_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/85_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"But people like it because they can really concentrate","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/86_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and if we're all playing well, it sounds quite impressive.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/87_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The only trouble is that he sometimes gets us to play one at a time, you know, alone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/88_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh... that's scary.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/89_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Um... it is, but I've got used to it now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/90_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"At the end he spends about five minutes telling us what to practise for the following week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/91_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, thanks Coleman.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/92_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll go and have a look at that website, I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam-19-test-2-part-1-2024-06-21-00-20-11/93_v3.mp3"}]
